l be delivered.\",\"example\":\"https://example.com/webhook\",\"format\":\"uri\",\"type\":\"string\"}},\"title\":\"Webhook Configuration\",\"type\":\"object\"}}},\"description\":\"Response\"}},\"securitySource\":\"unspecified\"}"
